'''Apples and Oranges''' (みかんとリンゴ, ''Mikan to Ringo'', '''Mandarin Oranges and Apples''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Cat Base Defense UP (Sm): Cat Base health is increased by 20%.

